## Quickstart (Under 10 Minutes, Zero API Keys Required)

Get a fully functional LLM gateway running locally against deterministic mock backends:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/proofgate/proofgate.git
cd proofgate
make quickstart
```

Test it immediately with `curl`:
```bash
KEY=$(cat .quickstart-key)
curl http://localhost:8080/v1/chat/completions \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $KEY" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"model":"default","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Hello ProofGate!"}]}'
```

Or with the official Python OpenAI SDK:
```python
from openai import OpenAI

client = OpenAI(base_url="http://localhost:8080/v1", api_key=open(".quickstart-key").read().strip())
resp = client.chat.completions.create(
    model="default",
    messages=[{"role": "user", "content": "Hello ProofGate!"}]
)
print(resp.choices[0].message.content)
```

Visit the Grafana analytics dashboard at [http://localhost:13000/d/proofgate](http://localhost:13000/d/proofgate).

